bench-hashes b3sum: how long b3sum takes to hash files, from its start to its exit

machine:   AMD EPYC 9255 24-Core Processor, 48 CPUs, linux7.0.0-38-generic
files on:  ext4 (/dev/md0 on /)
load:      quiet: other programs kept 0.04 CPUs busy on average, 0.26 in the busiest window
runs:      16 rounds, each contender once on each input in each

